### Test ROLLBACK Phase ###

## 1. Prepare a transaction first
POST http://localhost:8001/api/prepare
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-ROLLBACK-001-DEBIT",
    "account_id": "ACC003",
    "operation": "DEBIT",
    "amount": 200000.00
}

###

## 2. Rollback DEBIT - Success
POST http://localhost:8001/api/rollback
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-ROLLBACK-001-DEBIT"
}

###

## 3. Rollback - Idempotent (already aborted)
POST http://localhost:8001/api/rollback
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-ROLLBACK-001-DEBIT"
}

###

## 4. Rollback - Transaction Not Found
POST http://localhost:8001/api/rollback
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-NONEXISTENT"
}

###

## 5. Check account is unlocked after rollback
GET http://localhost:8001/api/accounts/ACC003

###

## 6. Check balance unchanged after rollback
GET http://localhost:8001/api/accounts/ACC003/balance

###

## 7. Check transaction log
GET http://localhost:8001/api/transactions?status_filter=ABORTED

###

## === Full Transfer then Rollback Scenario ===

## 8. Prepare DEBIT for transfer
POST http://localhost:8001/api/prepare
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-FAIL-001-DEBIT",
    "account_id": "ACC004",
    "operation": "DEBIT",
    "amount": 500000.00
}

###

## 9. Prepare CREDIT for transfer (simulate failure by using locked account)
POST http://localhost:8001/api/prepare
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-FAIL-001-CREDIT",
    "account_id": "ACC005",
    "operation": "CREDIT",
    "amount": 500000.00
}

###

## 10. Rollback DEBIT (because overall transfer failed)
POST http://localhost:8001/api/rollback
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-FAIL-001-DEBIT"
}

###

## 11. Rollback CREDIT
POST http://localhost:8001/api/rollback
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-FAIL-001-CREDIT"
}

###

## === Recovery Tools ===

## 12. Check pending transactions
GET http://localhost:8001/api/recovery/status

###

## 13. Force rollback all prepared
POST http://localhost:8001/api/recovery/force-rollback

###

## 14. Cleanup stale locks
POST http://localhost:8001/api/recovery/cleanup-locks
